{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop around and avoid a variety of unique bowlers with their eyes all set on one thing - <strong>striking you down</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and hold your cursor to build charge and slow down time, and then release yourself and hop to safety!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464560/extras/7cb21dfa551118311256e2a55401e3c9.poster.avif?t=1755278690\" width=274 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464560/extras/7cb21dfa551118311256e2a55401e3c9.webm?t=1755278690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464560/extras/7cb21dfa551118311256e2a55401e3c9.mp4?t=1755278690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will encounter different types of balls and bowler abilities which can not only knock you down, but also your fellow pins!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the balls and the tumbling pins to survive through 3 circuits with 3 bowlers each! <i>And maybe a secret 4th bowler?</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Circuit 1 - Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464560/ea76e18cde2edc6adb80510e387baa8f2aa43d23.jpg"},{"name":"Circuit 1 - Platinum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464560/fb553e3a6b3031216445cf1c6c7788d6292e9354.jpg"},{"name":"Circuit 2 - Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3464560/68b67aa53f41cf4b36978ff4f32c340981e46273.jpg"},{"name":"Circuit 2 - Platinum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste